  "productSlug": "fireflies",
  "shortDescription": "Fireflies.ai is an AI meeting notetaker (bot or Chrome extension) for Zoom, Google Meet, and Microsoft Teams. Transcription is unlimited on every plan; storage, video recording, conversation intelligence, and admin/compliance are the gates. Free is $0 with 400 minutes team storage. Pro is $10/seat/mo billed annually ($18 monthly) with 8,000 minutes/seat storage and video recording. Business (most popular) is $19/seat/mo annual ($29 monthly) with unlimited storage and conversation intelligence. Enterprise is $39/seat/mo annual-only (SSO, SCIM, HIPAA). Distinct from Otter.ai (meeting-notes peer) and from Microsoft 365 Copilot Teams recap (workspace LLM add-on).",
